s, upgrade your base, and unlock new vehicles and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/d1225eef11b2e64ac2be41b932ca8790.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.poster.avif?t=1766403822\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.webm?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/7125a4463e12a17a03c8f04f9acc15a7.mp4?t=1766403822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to play exciting missions in Free Operations Mode together! Drive in convoys, fortify outposts and defend your base against enemy attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947540/extras/fec3467e3d957619eb9c9e4199fef1a9.webp?t=1766403822\" width=781 height=53 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOSCON – Command Made Simple:</strong> Direct your convoy with Follow, Go-To, and Hold orders using a clear tactical HUD.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply Missions &amp; Base Building:</strong> Deliver critical resources and expand your FOB to unlock equipment and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense-by-Logistics:</strong> Counter drone and ground threats using point-defense launchers and mounted heavy machine guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>K9 Companion:</strong> Utilize your German Shepherd for detection and support tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land &amp; Carrier Operations:</strong> Experience missions across overland routes and aboard an aircraft carrier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player &amp; Co-Op:</strong> Command the convoy alone or bring a teammate into the field.</p></li></ul>",
